RORO KE YE KARTI THI BAYYAN ZAINAB-E-MUZTAR AYE OUN-O-MOHAMMAD,<br>
 SOTE HO KAHAN DASHT MEIN KHURBAN YE MAADAR AAYE OUN-O-MOHAMMAD <br>
<br>
PYAASE THE MAGAR NEHAR KO MUDH KAR NAHI DEKHA,<br>
 MAADAR SE JO WAADA THA KIYA USKO NIBHAYA,<br>
 SEHRAABH KARENGE TUMHE ABB SAAQIYE KOUSAR AAYE OUN-O-MOHAMMAD<br>
<br>
NARGHE MEIN HAIN KOOFFAR KE TAHNA MERA BHAIYYA,<br>
 HAMDAM HAI KOI AUR NA KOI HAI SAHARA,<br>
 QASIM HAI NA AKBAR HAI NA ABBAS-E-DILAWAR,<br>
AAYE OUN-O-MOHAMMAD<br>
<br>
KIS TARHA SE DUKHIYA YE ALAM DIL SE BHULAYE, SAR NAIZOU PA AADA NE TUMHARE HAI CHHADAYE,<br>
 AB CHEEN NE AAYE HAI MERE SAR SE WO CHADARA,<br>
AYE OUN-O-MOHAMMAD<br>
<br>
AB JAL CHOOKA AAYE LAADLO ZEHRA KA GULISTAAN,<br>
 AAYI HAI QAYAMAT KI TARAH SHAAM-E-GHAREEBA ,<br>
BE YAARO MADAD GAAR HUI ALL-E-PAIYAMBAR,<br>
AAYE OUN-O-MOHAMMAD<br>
<br>
FURKHAT KA TUMHARI MERE BACCHO YE ASAR,<br>
 HAI BE CHAAIN MERA DIL HAI PARESHAAN NAZAR HAI,<br>
 ITNA TOH BATADOKAHA DHOONDU TUMHE JAAKARA,<br>
AYE OUN-O-MOHAMMAD<br>
<br>
AHSAN YEHI ZAINAB NE KAHA SAJDE MEIN JAAKE,<br>
 KHURBAAN RAAH-E-HAQ MEIN HUE HAI MERE BACCHE ,<br>
KARTI THI ADA SHUKRE KHUDA LAASHO PA MAADAR,<br>
AAYE OUN-O-MOHAMMAD..